apshot tests, Clippy, 50 Python conformance tests, 46 Lua conformance tests plus 6 receiver/field tests. Lua resume_points initially passed 4/5: its late-region scheduling assertion failed despite correct output and LLVM transfer. All 5 passed on isolated rerun; 3 additional baseline/candidate runs per arm passed. This outstanding test determinism issue is recorded as 95111de, not hidden. Local TS: all 1413 cases pass. Complete pinned official TS: all 5948 files / 6825 rows, PASS 1151, FAIL 12, UNSUPPORTED 2234, SKIP 3428; regressions=[] with unchanged reviewed baseline.\n\nEvidence: /private/tmp/zyntax-osr-provenance/nuc-evidence.tar.gz, SHA-256 26affaea3572b73d32f12796c73ee7610588f59f2761ebfefed9c95a1fa5e50c. Includes scripts, hashes, thermal records, raw timings, checksums and NUC IR/machine-code traces. Local source hashes, full conformance reports, machine-code comparison and test failure/retry evidence are in the parent directory. The original NUC checkout and unrelated local dirty files were left untouched.","files":null}]}